    {
      "id": "annotation-slp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 165,
      "width": 366,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3b82f6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3200,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3200,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow (Standard / Combo / LowVolume):\n\u2026GetPartNumber (2) or GetSerialNumber (3)\n\u2192 GetSkidIdFromLicensePlate (12) \u2192 GetPalletQuantity (4)\n\nControl: SkidIdFromLicensePlate (UserControl, 367\u00d7327)\n\nStep is AUTO-SKIPPED when IsSkidIdFromLicensePlateRequired = false.\nOnly shown when the prod line requires a pre-printed Skid Id\n(e.g. 2D label part+serial scanned, or BoxLabel branch).\n\nLayout:\n\u2022 tbSkidId: 271\u00d720 at (6,56) \u2014 primary scan input\n\u2022 lblInvalidSerial: red error, hidden until validation fires\n\u2022 pnlGenNewSkidId + btnGenNewSkidId: shown only when replacement allowed",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow (Standard / Combo / LowVolume):\n\u2026GetPartNumber (2) or GetSerialNumber (3)\n\u2192 GetSkidIdFromLicensePlate (12) \u2192 GetPalletQuantity (4)\n\nControl: SkidIdFromLicensePlate (UserControl, 367\u00d7327)\n\nStep is AUTO-SKIPPED when IsSkidIdFromLicensePlateRequired = false.\nOnly shown when the prod line requires a pre-printed Skid Id\n(e.g. 2D label part+serial scanned, or BoxLabel branch).\n\nLayout:\n\u2022 tbSkidId: 271\u00d720 at (6,56) \u2014 primary scan input\n\u2022 lblInvalidSerial: red error, hidden until validation fires\n\u2022 pnlGenNewSkidId + btnGenNewSkidId: shown only when replacement allowed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-slp-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 366,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3201,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Validation (each yields a blocking error):\n\u2022 Skid Id is required\n\u2022 License Plate not found for Skid Id (shows reassignment chain)\n\u2022 Scanned serial not found on the Skid License Plate\n\u2022 Scanned model not found on the LP (unless pre-existing combo/std OK)\n\u2022 Skid Id already on a claim in past 9 years\n\nIf replacement is allowed when the 9-yr check fires:\n  shows pnlGenNewSkidId \u2014 \"Generate New Skid Id\" \u2192 creates new id,\n  partial claim required.\n\nNavigation: Next \u2192 GetPalletQuantity (4)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Validation (each yields a blocking error):\n\u2022 Skid Id is required\n\u2022 License Plate not found for Skid Id (shows reassignment chain)\n\u2022 Scanned serial not found on the Skid License Plate\n\u2022 Scanned model not found on the LP (unless pre-existing combo/std OK)\n\u2022 Skid Id already on a claim in past 9 years\n\nIf replacement is allowed when the 9-yr check fires:\n  shows pnlGenNewSkidId \u2014 \"Generate New Skid Id\" \u2192 creates new id,\n  partial claim required.\n\nNavigation: Next \u2192 GetPalletQuantity (4)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
  "appState": {
    "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"
  },
  "files": {}
}